---
import { gateDetailImage, staircaseImage } from "../data/images"
---

<section
  class="relative bg-background py-section"
  aria-labelledby="details-heading"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-landing px-container-x sm:px-8 xl:px-14">
    <p
      class="reveal mb-6 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted"
    >
      Architecture in detail
    </p>

    <h2
      id="details-heading"
      class="reveal max-w-heading font-display text-headline-1 font-bold leading-[1.05] text-foreground"
    >
      Not Buildings. Details.
    </h2>

    <p
      class="reveal mt-6 max-w-copy text-base leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-lg"
    >
      The character of Budapest reveals itself not in its monuments but in the
      details between them — wrought iron balconies, ceramic tiles, carved stone
      faces, Art Nouveau doorways, spiral staircases, and the intricate
      metalwork that lines every grand avenue.
    </p>

    <!-- Irregular editorial grid -->
    <div
      class="mt-16 grid gap-6 sm:mt-20 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-8"
    >
      <!-- Gate detail — large, spans 2 cols -->
      <figure class="reveal sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
          <img
            src={`${gateDetailImage.src}&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80`}
            srcset={`${gateDetailImage.src}&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80 600w, ${gateDetailImage.src}&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80 900w, ${gateDetailImage.src}&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80 1200w`}
            sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 90vw, 800px"
            alt={gateDetailImage.alt}
            title={`Photo by ${gateDetailImage.author} on Unsplash`}
            width={gateDetailImage.width}
            height={gateDetailImage.height}
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="photo-tone aspect-[3/2] w-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <figcaption class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted">
          Photo by <a
            href={gateDetailImage.authorUrl}
            class="underline hover:text-foreground"
            rel="noopener">{gateDetailImage.author}</a
          >
          on <a
            href={gateDetailImage.unsplashUrl}
            class="underline hover:text-foreground"
            rel="noopener">Unsplash</a
          >
        </figcaption>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-headline-3 font-bold text-foreground">
          Art Nouveau Doorways
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Budapest embraced the Secession movement at the turn of the 20th
          century, filling its residential and commercial buildings with organic
          forms in glass and metal that remain among Europe's finest examples of
          the style.
        </p>
      </figure>

      <!-- Staircase — vertical -->
      <figure class="reveal">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
          <img
            src={`${staircaseImage.src}&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80`}
            srcset={`${staircaseImage.src}&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80 300w, ${staircaseImage.src}&w=450&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80 450w, ${staircaseImage.src}&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80 600w`}
            sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 45vw, 400px"
            alt={staircaseImage.alt}
            title={`Photo by ${staircaseImage.author} on Unsplash`}
            width={staircaseImage.width}
            height={staircaseImage.height}
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="photo-tone aspect-[3/4] w-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <figcaption class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted">
          Photo by <a
            href={staircaseImage.authorUrl}
            class="underline hover:text-foreground"
            rel="noopener">{staircaseImage.author}</a
          >
          on <a
            href={staircaseImage.unsplashUrl}
            class="underline hover:text-foreground"
            rel="noopener">Unsplash</a
          >
        </figcaption>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-headline-3 font-bold text-foreground">
          Spiral Staircases
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Behind closed doors, Budapest's apartment buildings conceal dramatic
          staircases with ornate iron railings that spiral upward through five
          or six stories of light.
        </p>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial phrase -->
    <blockquote class="reveal mt-20 max-w-2xl sm:mt-28">
      <p
        class="font-display text-headline-2 font-bold italic leading-snug text-foreground"
      >
        "History is not behind Budapest. It is beneath every step."
      </p>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>
